Source code (AGPL-3.0 section 13)
---------------------------------
The Corresponding Source of this fork is this repository:
https://github.com/avalynnrose/aperture . Container images built from it carry the
label org.opencontainers.image.source and a release tag (for example v0.7.10-fork.4);
the tag identifies the exact source. The running application shows a "Source code"
link on the sign-in page and in the sidebar. If you modify this software and let others
use it over a network, you must offer them your modified source in the same way; change
the link in apps/web/src/components/SourceLink.tsx to point at it.

Modifications relative to upstream v0.7.10 (upstream commit 99cc9369df)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Dates are the dates the changes were made; release tags are annotated tags in this repository.

2026-10-22  v0.7.10-fork.1
  - Top Picks Requester setting: choose which Seerr user is credited with automatic
    requests (migration 0115).
  - TV season selection for automatic requests: all seasons or season 1 only (migration 0115).
  - Container health check uses 127.0.0.1 instead of localhost.
  - Continuous-integration workflow (tests, type check, lint, build, migration replay).

2026-10-22  v0.7.10-fork.2
  - Auto-request rules (migration 0116): selection strategies (Missing-first, Strict Top N,
    Fill to N), country / genre / TMDB keyword filters, optional hybrid-blend ranking,
    per-run request cap, read-only preview shared with the job, confirmation for manual runs.
  - Publishing safeguards: image publishing only by manual, owner-approved, tag-bound workflow.

2026-10-23  v0.7.10-fork.3
  - "Top N Eligible" selection strategy (new default) and "Skip unreleased titles" switch.
    No new migration (stored inside the existing rules JSON).

2026-10-23  v0.7.10-fork.4
  - Skip individual titles from the auto-request preview (saved per media type).
    No new migration.

2026-10-23  public-release preparation
  - README rewritten for this fork; docker-compose.fork.yml (build from source) and
    docker-compose.fork-image.example.yml; docs/fork/*; this NOTICE file.
  - "Source code" links in the application and API metadata.
  - Removed the unused upstream branch-sync workflow (.github/workflows/sync-dev.yml).
